        "semanticLevel": "detail",
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "# Primitive Template Collection\n\nGive each of the 9 primitives (Declaration, View, Glyph, Content, Port, Portal, Membrane, Method, Bridge) its own dedicated template, each demonstrating the port/glyph/color design validated this session -- the reference future edge-primitive, custom-handle, and page-template work builds on instead of rediscovering.\n\nStatus: **draft sketch, for review** -- not yet an implementation commitment."
        }
      }
    },
